<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya suspended at firm's request-KLSE.</title>
<headline>Berjaya suspended at firm's request-KLSE.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of diversified Berjaya Group Bhd and two of its subsidiaries were suspended at the firm's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>The two other stocks are that of gaming and property firm Berjaya Sports Toto Bhd, and leisure and hotels group Berjaya Leisure Bhd.</p>
<p>The company did not say why it asked for the suspensions, the official said.  </p>
<p>Officials at Berjaya Group were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
